      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CARISSA'S BABY (1) was checked in the run when fifth in a Grade 4 at this track last time over 340m, finishing 2.25 lengths from the winner (19.70). Has Box 1 this time where she has two wins. Well worth another try. PINAROO FLYER (2) missed the frame and safely held latest finishing 7th at this track following on from a win (19.65) there the start prior. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has the ability to give this a shake. AARIELLA'S GIRL (4) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only one length (19.42) behind Frenzy at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from eight starts. Can feature again. HADES DANGER (5) was a shock winner last start and can measure up again.",
